OL,3,A'Significant casualties' after fire on
OL,4,Acargo ship in eastern China
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fire has broken out on a
OL,7,Fforeign-flagged cargo ship docked at an
OL,8,Feastern Chinese port, causing
OL,9,Fsignificant casualties, according to
OL,10,Fstate media.
OL,12,FPresident Xi Jinping called for urgent
OL,13,Fsearch and rescue efforts and a swift
OL,14,Finvestigation.
OL,16,FPremier Li Qiang called for "trapped"
OL,17,Fpeople to be rescued and stressed the
OL,18,Fneed to "prevent secondary disasters".
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
