OL,3,A'Significant casualties' after fire on
OL,4,Acargo ship in eastern China
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe vessel was undergoing maintenance
OL,7,Fat a shipyard in the city of Qingdao
OL,8,Fwhen the blaze occurred at 11:15 local
OL,9,Ftime (03:15 GMT), state news agency
OL,10,FXinhua said.
